Install
~~~~~~~

NOTE!!!!    THIS WALL WORKS ONLY ON 020+ MACHINE!!!!!

Just copy the directory 'WALL' to your DOORS:
And then, copy the commands dir to your BBSCMD
And thats it! Just type WALL at the prompt in /X.

Enjoy!


